{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gXJIZrcGKd1795181224.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>澳門大賽車GT世界盃，晏高排位賽第六完成，香港的隊友方駿宇第17名完成。</p><p></p><p>CBR車隊的方駿宇，駕駛「布丁狗」主題車花的76號平治，第13次在東望洋賽道角逐，隊友晏高駕駛77號平治，在首節排位賽，圈速是全場第六快，方駿宇落後。</p><p></p><p>晏高早前表示，曾在2022年與歐陽若曦及整個團隊，合作勝出賽事，今次很高興再聚。</p><p></p><p>這位41歲德國車手，首節落後冠軍0.867秒，第6名完成，頭八車手之後再鬥一節，晏高都是以第6完賽。方駿宇排第17名。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T17:04:29.676293+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T13:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T12:37:15.059073+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:57:44.063767+00:00","content_hash":"d0cce44f932419381934746db77bc1a0c88ef5635c48cb6303874586eb9ffdc1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T17:04:29.676293+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}